WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Kamera ikusonyeza anthu akudikira ku chipatala cha matenda osapatsirana.

00:00:49.605 --> 00:01:09.605
Vidiyoyi ikutsatira njira yoyezera maso ku chipatalako.

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:59.210
Woyezayo akugwiritsa ntchito chipangizo cha m'manja kuyang'ana mkati mwa diso.

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:48.815
Chitsanzo chimodzi chili ndi mawu akuti maculopathy.
